# Email Service

All outbound email goes via Resend (`https://api.resend.com/emails`). Send functions never throw — email failures are caught, logged, and never fail the parent request.

## Architecture

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Senders["src/lib/email/templates.ts"]
        BI[sendBookingInvite]
        BC[sendBookingConfirmation]
        BR[sendBookingReminder]
        AW[sendAcademyWaitlist]
        MI[sendMembershipInvite]
    end

    subgraph Client["src/lib/email/client.ts"]
        SE[sendEmail]
        SER[sendEmailWithRetry\nexp backoff: 200ms 400ms 800ms]
    end

    subgraph Templates["D1 email_templates"]
        T[(booking_invite\nbooking_confirmation\nbooking_reminder\nacademy_waitlist\nacademy_invite\nmembership_invite)]
    end

    Senders -->|getEmailTemplateByKey| Templates
    Senders --> SER
    SER --> SE
    SE -->|POST| Resend([api.resend.com])
```

## Template senders

| Function | Template key | Triggered by |
|---|---|---|
| `sendBookingInvite()` | `booking_invite` | Enquiry processed (taster path) + admin resend |
| `sendBookingConfirmation()` | `booking_confirmation` | Successful booking |
| `sendBookingReminder()` | `booking_reminder` | Cron — 7 days before session |
| `sendAcademyWaitlist()` | `academy_waitlist` | Enquiry processed (Academy path) + admin manual send |
| `sendMembershipInvite()` | `membership_invite` | Admin marks booking as attended |

All return `{ success: boolean, error?: string, id?: string }`.

## Template variable substitution

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    DB[(email_templates\nD1)] -->|getEmailTemplateByKey| HTML[Template HTML\n{{contact_name}} {{session_date}}]
    Data[Runtime data\nenquiry booking config] --> Vars[Build vars dict]
    HTML & Vars --> Render[renderTemplate\nbusiness/templates.ts]
    Render -->|All vars present| Email[Rendered HTML]
    Render -->|Missing var| Fail[Return error\nnever throws into handler]
```

Available sample variables for preview/testing are defined in `SAMPLE_TEMPLATE_VARS` in `src/lib/business/templates.ts`.

## Preview endpoint

`GET /api/admin/templates/:id/preview` renders a template with sample variables and returns the HTML — used by the admin template editor's live preview iframe.

## Test send

`POST /api/admin/templates/:id/test-send` sends a rendered template to `ADMIN_EMAIL` only. Any other address returns `403 FORBIDDEN_RECIPIENT`.

